<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινο-ποιέω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκαινοποίηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.2.4
				</span></i>
			:—<i>make new, renew</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν θεραπείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					15.25.17
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐλπίδας</span>
			<i>gives new life to</i> hopes, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.70.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τά τινος ἁμαρτήματα</span>
			<i>renew the memory of . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				30.4.17
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκαινοποιήθη τὰ τῆς ὀργῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					21.31.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				31.28.9
			</span></i>; of a plaster, <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				7.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make changes, innovate</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ
			κ</span>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τύχη</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.4.5
			</span></i>, etc.: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Prom.Es</u>
				3
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί καινοποιηθὲν
			λέγεις</span>; what <i>new-fangled, strange</i> words are
			these? <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i><i>-Tr.</i><i><span class="en">
				873
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.2.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ καινοποιηθέντα</span>
			<i>innovations</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				669.44
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				237 viii 42
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
